---
// Quiz figure for Post 2: the footer of a project settings page with four solid buttons.
---
<div class="qfig-uxq02buttonrows">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 600 170" role="img" aria-label="Footer of a Project settings page with four solid buttons in a row: Delete project, large and bold on red c62828; Cancel on grey 5b6470; Preview on green 2e7d32; Save changes on blue 2754b8.">
    <rect x="6" y="6" width="588" height="158" rx="10" class="card" />
    <text x="26" y="40" class="head"><tspan data-lang-en>Project settings</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Cài đặt dự án</tspan></text>
    <text x="26" y="64" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>You changed the project name and the deploy branch.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Bạn đã đổi tên dự án và nhánh deploy.</tspan></text>
    <rect x="26" y="88" width="168" height="54" rx="7" style="fill:#c62828" />
    <text x="110" y="122" text-anchor="middle" class="btn big"><tspan data-lang-en>Delete project</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xoá dự án</tspan></text>
    <rect x="206" y="94" width="90" height="42" rx="7" style="fill:#5b6470" />
    <text x="251" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="btn"><tspan data-lang-en>Cancel</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Huỷ</tspan></text>
    <rect x="308" y="94" width="104" height="42" rx="7" style="fill:#2e7d32" />
    <text x="360" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="btn"><tspan data-lang-en>Preview</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Xem trước</tspan></text>
    <rect x="424" y="94" width="150" height="42" rx="7" style="fill:#2754b8" />
    <text x="499" y="121" text-anchor="middle" class="btn"><tspan data-lang-en>Save changes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Lưu thay đổi</tspan></text>
  </svg>
</div>

<style>
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows { margin: 0; width: 100%; }
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 320px; height: auto; }
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows .card { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows .head { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows .sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows .btn { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; fill: #ffffff; }
  .qfig-uxq02buttonrows .btn.big { font-size: 17px; font-weight: 800; }
</style>
